{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, approach it, then grab it and move to destination for specific task. Scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    />",
